INTERPRETATION
------------------------------------------------------------------------ 
  Compare the ML-based indirect effect from lavaan and manymome with
  the MM-estimates of 03_robust_mediation.R. The difference between
  the two shows how much the observations that MM-estimation
  downweights move the ML estimates.
  
  The lavaan + manymome architecture separates model fitting from
  effect computation: one set of bootstrap replicates (do_boot) can
  be queried for multiple indirect paths, conditional effects, or
  standardised effects without re-bootstrapping.
